      "llm_score": 2,
      "corrected_score": 3,
      "comment": "It does connect the sources to the gap. The empty church sections are followed straight away by the PRONI Guide for film numbers, plus UHF, RootsIreland and FindMyPast under the Presbyterian heading. No repository can fill a Catholic gap before 1828 where the registers were never kept, so the judge is asking for something impossible there."
